Lance!

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:13.080
Precure Love Link!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:14.640
L-O-V-E!

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:15.440
L-O-V-E!

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:16.150
L-O-V-E!

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:17.260
L-O-V-E!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.760
The warmth of the sun,

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:42.810
Cure Rosetta!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.080
Oh poor pig who has lost his love,

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.270
I, Cure Heart,

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:52.510
will make your heart race once more!

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:55.470
Today's the day...

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:59.590
that I kick all your butts!

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.030
It's you again?

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:03.720
You're really persistent.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.870
Well, right back at you.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.100
Whoop 'em, Selfish!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.330
This too!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.690
Quit eating and get 'em!

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:17.380
The restaurant...

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.040
It's eating it!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.890
Such poor manners!

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:25.500
You'll get a stomachache if you eat that!

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:29.740
It's getting bigger!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:33.850
Well fed children really do grow up bigger!

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:36.580
This is no time for admiration!

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:41.670
Ooooomelette rice!

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:43.290
I want that omelette rice!

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:45.680
I want that omelette rice!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.970
Omelette rice!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.100
Davi!

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.380
I've waited...

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:52.980
for that look.

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:58.030
Davi!

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:02.690
