00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:40.030
Cure Sword!

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:45.870
Makopi is Cure Sword!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:47.700
I, Cure Sword,

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:51.830
shall sever your ambitions with the blade of love!

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:55.840
It's her!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.210
She finally showed us her identity!

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:01.070
Davi!

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:07.950
Glitter!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.850
Holy Sword!

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.890
Oink?!

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:17.530
Love love looooove!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:27.530
Huh?

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:31.840
I remember bein' hungry, then what?

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:34.920
I'll remember this!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.280
Makopi!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:40.720
So you really are Cure Sword!

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:42.710
I'm all choked up!

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:44.460
I couldn't quite do it in secret. {* 見ていられなかっただけよ}

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:49.060
We've been waiting for this moment!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:51.310
Yeah!

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:55.630
We want you to join us!

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:00.540
<i>I feel the same way...</i>

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:05.100
<i>That's why I came here...</i>

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:08.980
Thank you.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.460
I've been waiting...

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:27.300
for you four to be under one roof.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:29.260
Who are you?

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.560
You don't need my name.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:35.790
This'll be the last time we meet.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.630
Farewell, Precure!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:54.350
This world won't see your light ever again.

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:58.220
It belongs to the Selfish now.

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:28.260
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:31.160
An Intense Battle!

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:31.160
An Intense Battle!

00:22:31.360 --> 00:22:33.430
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
